<title>USA: O'Charley's sees about $0.18 added Q4 EPS.</title>
<headline>O'Charley's sees about $0.18 added Q4 EPS.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>O'Charley's Inc said Wednesday it will report additional pre-tax earnings of about $2.2 million to $2.5 million, or about $0.18 per share after-tax, in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>The company made the adjustment because of what it said was a relatively low number of claims submitted in a two-year-old class action lawsuit involving racial discrimination.</p>
<p>A U.S. District Court has approved a settlement of the suit, the company said.</p>
</text>
